  "production_scope": "Exactly per-level finite replica participation in AmrProgramContext::norm2. Original component0 dot_active_local products, local sums, EB active masks, selected levels, global sum and sqrt remain. Finite replicated contribution enters via prepared lane rank0; every copy is evaluated and any nonfinite contribution retained. No world-size factor, volume/composite-cover change, thresholds/model arithmetic/API syntax/data layout or ABI-number change.",
  "baseline_primitive": "Authentic unchanged-header2case run: distributed norm8 on1/2ranks; replica norm8 on1rank but8sqrt2=11.313708498984761 on2ranks, failing expected8. ncomp2 preserves comp0 only. Original authentic stdout/json/source retained; primitive-baseline-world*.xml filenames were overwritten by later candidate runs and are excluded as baseline evidence.",
  "actual_public_negatives": "Original admitted13casecohort retained: MPI2 retry and populatedhistory failed onbothranks. Instrumented exact unchanged scalar +readonly reductions observed retry-after-shrink actual0.10479918293744765 vs onecopy0.07410421291787876; populatedfirst39.773791213065074 vs28.12431748025623. Original thresholds.1/30 unchanged.",
  "paired_generic_JIT_experiment": "Exact generic member specialization using original headers/SDKde2/currentDim2 profile with admittedexistingNativef8d. Both original public tests pass onbothMPI2ranks, identity mismatches[]. This is a bounded JIT prototype, not official newSDK/native acceptance.",
  "targeted_proofs": "V1 four realAMR-context tests passworld1 and2perrank: distributed/replicated, ncomp2 comp0contrast, last-rankNaN preserved, reversedmultiowner, emptyrank andmixedlevels. FinalV2 onlymixedfixture/doc strengthened: direct values/cell-coordinate census16coarse+64fine, masknull/EBscope, fourpartitionedfinepatches withtwoactuallyownedbyeachMPI2rank, independentconstant sqrt320. Targetedmixed1/2rankrerunpasses withdistinctXML.",
  "complete_suite_limits": "V1 fullMPI2 target9/9 passed onbothranks (stdout retained). Fullworld1 target8/9: preexisting PendingProofSurvivesPublicationAndRejectsRankLocalDamage failed identically in unchanged-header baseline. No waiver/fix claimed; this case does not call contextnorm2. FinalV2 changed only mixedcensus+doc, no broad identicalrerun. GPU/3D/higherworldsizes and official rebuiltSDK acceptance unrun.",
